    "storyline": {
      "real": "H\u00e4kkinen leads from pole until a transmission glitch on lap 4 lets Barrichello and Schumacher by. Schumacher leads after Barrichello's lap-27 stop, with H\u00e4kkinen held up behind him. Ferrari bring Schumacher in on lap 38; H\u00e4kkinen pushes for a few laps, stops on lap 42 and comes out still in front. He wins by 4.9 s."
    },
