    "briefing": "Interlagos, 1999. H\u00e4kkinen started on pole, but a transmission glitch on lap 4 dropped him behind Barrichello and Schumacher. You run H\u00e4kkinen, second after 35 laps and 1.1 s behind Schumacher, both on one stop. Ferrari will pit first: stay out, find the time and win."
